{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00379",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "um, good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.11,
      "end_seconds": 15.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.3,
      "end_seconds": 22.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "good morning, doctor i came along to help out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.15,
      "end_seconds": 28.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.42,
      "end_seconds": 33.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "I wanted to get foamy urine looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.98,
      "end_seconds": 37.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 38.4,
      "end_seconds": 49.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar, doctor. He takes diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when I get pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 50.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.17,
      "end_seconds": 57.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I had glimepiride at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.86,
      "end_seconds": 61.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.28,
      "end_seconds": 66.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I'd say three days, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 68.78,
      "end_seconds": 72.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "It was closer to five days, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.39,
      "end_seconds": 80.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.5,
      "end_seconds": 85.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "oh, yes, somewhere around that that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.48,
      "end_seconds": 87.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.42,
      "end_seconds": 93.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Oh, and tiredness. That's been about the same, two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.24,
      "end_seconds": 101.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "A few quick ones: reduced urine output, chest pain, breathlessness or blood in the urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.82,
      "end_seconds": 106.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I mean, no. None of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.17,
      "end_seconds": 110.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Did you notice any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.88,
      "end_seconds": 112.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Nope, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.99,
      "end_seconds": 115.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.66,
      "end_seconds": 122.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Well, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.36,
      "end_seconds": 127.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.93,
      "end_seconds": 133.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Hmm, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.93,
      "end_seconds": 136.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.04,
      "end_seconds": 141.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "just a a knee arthroscopy, three years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.01,
      "end_seconds": 145.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.71,
      "end_seconds": 166.07,
      "duration_seconds": 19.36,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago. I don't drink at all. I skip breakfast most days. I share a flat with two friends. I walk for about half an hour most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.63,
      "end_seconds": 188.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Do your parents or siblings have any long-term illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.16,
      "end_seconds": 192.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "my father was diabetic"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.71,
      "end_seconds": 198.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Right, have you ever reacted badly to a medicine or food? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.73,
      "end_seconds": 203.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Well, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.91,
      "end_seconds": 207.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you got any chronic problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.97,
      "end_seconds": 214.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "I've, I've had kidney disease for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.22,
      "end_seconds": 216.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Is there more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.59,
      "end_seconds": 223.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.46,
      "end_seconds": 226.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "And apart from that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.95,
      "end_seconds": 231.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.78,
      "end_seconds": 241.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.58,
      "end_seconds": 263.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 161 over 93, saturation 96 percent, temperature is 36.4 degrees. And pulse 94."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.91,
      "end_seconds": 269.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "if you're comfortable, I'll examine you now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.9,
      "end_seconds": 272.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "let me just check something"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.12,
      "end_seconds": 291.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "there's pitting swelling at both ankles, and your blood pressure is on the high side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.38,
      "end_seconds": 297.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.12,
      "end_seconds": 336.4,
      "duration_seconds": 23.28,
      "text": "let's book an ultrasound of the kidneys to look into chronic kidney disease keep an eye on salt and protein portions, a dietitian can help with the specifics. A urine protein test is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.45,
      "end_seconds": 341.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Yes, I'll keep that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.59,
      "end_seconds": 351.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.01,
      "end_seconds": 359.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.39,
      "end_seconds": 364.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "yes, exactly right any last questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.43,
      "end_seconds": 370.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Okay, so no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.73,
      "end_seconds": 374.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Safe journey home."
    }
  ]
}